{#
    The button that starts an attempt, as a hookable of its own so that the option to keep the card
    sits above it rather than below. Disabled here and enabled by the script once the gateway's
    frames report ready: a page whose script never ran shows a button that does nothing rather
    than one that promises to.

    Marked as belonging to the new-card path, like the fields, so that choosing a saved card puts
    it away — that path has a button of its own. `label` is optional: the account's add-a-card
    page includes this file with a label of its own.
#}
<button
    type="button"
    id="nmi-card-pay"
    class="btn btn-primary"
    data-nmi-new-card-only
    disabled
    {{ sylius_test_html_attribute('nmi-card-pay') }}
>
    {{ label|default('jpm_martin_sylius_nmi.shop.pay.pay_now'|trans) }}
</button>
